WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.821
This is Knoxville Flooring's application,
built by Catalyst Innovations.

2
00:00:03.831 --> 00:00:08.078
We are using sample information to show
how room measurements

3
00:00:08.088 --> 00:00:12.335
become an estimate. Start by choosing a
room and entering

4
00:00:12.345 --> 00:00:16.591
its length and width. The estimator
calculates the floor area,

5
00:00:16.601 --> 00:00:19.571
keeping the measurements and the quantity
together.

6
00:00:19.581 --> 00:00:22.551
Next, review the assumptions around the
work.

7
00:00:22.561 --> 00:00:26.808
Waste allowance, material costs, and labor
all affect the estimate.

8
00:00:26.818 --> 00:00:31.064
Preparation matters too. The application
includes options for work such

9
00:00:31.074 --> 00:00:35.314
as tear-out and subfloor repair, so those
details can be

10
00:00:35.324 --> 00:00:37.391
considered alongside the flooring itself.

11
00:00:37.401 --> 00:00:40.715
As the inputs change, review the updated
summary.

12
00:00:40.725 --> 00:00:44.869
It brings the quantity, entered costs,
suggested price, and estimated

13
00:00:44.879 --> 00:00:49.024
margin into one view. These are sample
calculations, not a

14
00:00:49.034 --> 00:00:53.178
promise of profit. Finally, the proposal
handoff provides a next

15
00:00:53.188 --> 00:00:57.333
step from the estimate. We are stopping
before creating or

16
00:00:57.343 --> 00:00:59.410
sending anything to a customer.

17
00:00:59.420 --> 00:01:02.318
Measurements, job details, and pricing
stay connected.

18
00:01:02.328 --> 00:01:06.473
Talk with Catalyst about building software
around the way your

19
00:01:06.483 --> 00:01:08.580
team estimates and manages work.

